{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c205175-db0e-11ef-b486-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c20515d-db0e-11ef-9a71-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"扶風","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fbe-db0e-11ef-a8d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周公","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fbf-db0e-11ef-b89f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成王","people_name_jianti_auto":"成王","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc0-db0e-11ef-8c56-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"召公","people_name_jianti_auto":"召公","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc1-db0e-11ef-9691-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周公","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc2-db0e-11ef-9593-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成王","people_name_jianti_auto":"成王","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc3-db0e-11ef-a2f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成王","people_name_jianti_auto":"成王","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc4-db0e-11ef-b2d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周公","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc5-db0e-11ef-b502-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"管","place_name_jianti_auto":"管","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc6-db0e-11ef-a285-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc7-db0e-11ef-a995-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"商","place_name_jianti_auto":"商","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc8-db0e-11ef-ae8b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"奄","place_name_jianti_auto":"奄","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fc9-db0e-11ef-a24c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：尚書曰：周公爲師，相成王，爲左右，召公不悅。言周公旣還政成王，宜自退，今復爲相，故不悅也。四國，謂管、蔡、商、奄也。成王幼小，周公攝政，四國流言曰：公將不利於孺子。說，讀曰悅。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：尚书曰：周公为师，相成王，为左右，召公不悦。言周公既还政成王，宜自退，今复为相，故不悦也。四国，谓管、蔡、商、奄也。成王幼小，周公摄政，四国流言曰：公将不利于孺子。说，读曰悦。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fbd-db0e-11ef-a0bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fce-db0e-11ef-956b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：宂，散也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：宂，散也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":162,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fcd-db0e-11ef-90ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此保傅，謂四輔也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此保傅，谓四辅也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":189,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fcf-db0e-11ef-83f5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","resolved_place_entity_id":10164,"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92c1b94e-db0e-11ef-852d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"扶風功曹申屠剛以直言對策曰：「臣聞成王幼少，周公攝政，聽言下賢，均權布寵，動順天地，舉措不失；然近則召公不說，遠則四國流言。今聖主始免襁褓，卽位以來，至親分離，外戚杜隔，恩不得通。且漢家之制，雖任英賢，猶援姻戚，親疏相錯，杜塞間隙，誠所以安宗廟，重社稷也。宜亟遣使者徵中山太后，置之別宮，令時朝見，又召馮、衞二族，裁與宂職，使得執戟親奉宿衞，以抑患禍之端，上安社稷，下全保傅。」莽令太后下詔曰：「剛所言僻經妄說，違背大義！」罷歸田里。","content_fanyi":"扶风功曹申屠刚以直言对策说：“我听说周成王年幼，周公摄政，能听取直言、礼遇贤士，均衡权力、广施恩宠，行动顺应天地，举措没有过失；然而近处召公不悦，远处四国散布流言。如今圣主刚刚脱离襁褓，即位以来，至亲分离，外戚被隔绝，恩情不能通达。况且汉家制度，虽然任用英贤，仍要援引姻戚，使亲疏互相交错，杜塞嫌隙，确实是用以安定宗庙、尊崇社稷的。应当急速派遣使者征召中山太后，把她安置在别宫，让她按时朝见；又召来冯氏、卫氏两族，酌情授予冗散官职，使他们能够执戟亲自承当宿卫，以此遏制祸患的苗头，上可安定社稷，下可保全保傅。”王莽让太皇太后下诏说：“申屠刚所说偏离经义、妄加陈说，违背大义！”罢免他的官职，遣回乡里。","content_jianti_auto":"扶风功曹申屠刚以直言对策曰：「臣闻成王幼少，周公摄政，听言下贤，均权布宠，动顺天地，举措不失；然近则召公不说，远则四国流言。今圣主始免襁褓，即位以来，至亲分离，外戚杜隔，恩不得通。且汉家之制，虽任英贤，犹援姻戚，亲疏相错，杜塞间隙，诚所以安宗庙，重社稷也。宜亟遣使者征中山太后，置之别宫，令时朝见，又召冯、衞二族，裁与宂职，使得执戟亲奉宿衞，以抑患祸之端，上安社稷，下全保傅。」莽令太后下诏曰：「刚所言僻经妄说，违背大义！」罢归田里。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2709,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三十五 (漢紀二十七) / 孝平皇帝上 / 元始元年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"92bf6fbc-db0e-11ef-be1c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":1},"tongjian_id":"92bf6fbc-db0e-11ef-be1c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"扶風","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"92efa543-db0e-11ef-9f44-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣饒縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"广饶县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"92efa544-db0e-11ef-ac03-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"地理志，齊郡有廣饒縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"地理志，齐郡有广饶县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"92efa542-db0e-11ef-855a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92efa547-db0e-11ef-a986-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"扈","people_name_jianti_auto":"扈","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"92efa548-db0e-11ef-98f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"peo