","note_content_jianti_auto":"三七二百一十年，汉元至是岁二百一十四年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"92efa553-db0e-11ef-ab7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"92efa558-db0e-11ef-a81c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"92efa559-db0e-11ef-ad6c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十六行本「長」下有「曰」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十六行本「长」下有「曰」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92efa557-db0e-11ef-a411-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"92efa556-db0e-11ef-91ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92efa55b-db0e-11ef-b416-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：誠，實也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：诚，实也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":166,"tongjian_id":"92efa55a-db0e-11ef-be3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92efa55d-db0e-11ef-aff4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：壬子之日冬至，而其日當建。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：壬子之日冬至，而其日当建。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":185,"tongjian_i