"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"92efa568-db0e-11ef-ba36-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋庠","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋庠","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"92efa569-db0e-11ef-939f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：莽傳作「初始」。荀紀及韋莊美嘉號錄、宋庠紀年通譜皆作「始初」。今從之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：莽传作「初始」。荀纪及韦庄美嘉号录、宋庠纪年通谱皆作「始初」。今从之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":347,"tongjian_id":"92efa566-db0e-11ef-8d5f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92efa570-db0e-11ef-aee0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：隆，長也。成就之，使其長大也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：隆，长也。成就之，使其长大也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":372,"tongjian_id":"92efa56f-db0e-11ef-835f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周公","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"92efa572-db0e-11ef-b5ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔安國","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔安国","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"92efa573-db0e-11ef-8fba-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周公","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"92efa574-db0e-11ef-992a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成王","people_name_jianti_auto":"成王","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"92efa575-db0e-11ef-8e4d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"書·洛誥：周公拜手稽首曰：朕復子明辟。孔安國註曰：周公盡禮致敬，言我復還明君之政於子。子，成王也。年二十成人，故必歸政。","note_content_jianti_auto":"书·洛诰：周公拜手稽首曰：朕复子明辟。孔安国注曰：周公尽礼致敬，言我复还明君之政于子。子，成王也。年二十成人，故必归政。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":418,"tongjian_id":"92efa571-db0e-11ef-b014-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"92efa57a-db0e-11ef-bee3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十六行本「公」作「臣」；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十六行本「公」作「臣」；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"92efa579-db0e-11ef-802a-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":433,"tongjian_id":"92efa578-db0e-11ef-baa9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"92efa541-db0e-11ef-946e-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"è","source_anchor_text":"世三七之阸承天威命","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":69,"text":"阸","tongjian_id":"ad90966c-d133-543c-9b32-edfb0a79854f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","resolved_place_entity_id":10164,"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"92efa581-db0e-11ef-9881-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6是歲，廣饒侯劉京言齊郡新井，車騎將軍千人扈雲言巴郡石牛，太保屬臧鴻言扶風雍石；莽皆迎受。十一月，甲子，莽奏太后曰：「陛下遇漢十二世三七之阸，承天威命，詔臣莽居攝。廣饒侯劉京上書言：『七月中，齊郡臨淄縣昌興亭長辛當一暮數夢，曰：「吾，天公使也。天公使我告亭長：『攝皇帝當爲眞。』卽不信我，此亭中當有新井。」亭長晨起視亭中，誠有新井，入地且百尺。』十一月，壬子，直建冬至，巴郡石牛；戊午，雍石文，皆到于未央宮之前殿。臣與太保安陽侯舜等視，天風起，塵冥，風止，得銅符帛圖於石前，文曰：『天告帝符，獻者封侯，』騎都尉崔發等視說。孔子曰：『畏天命，畏大人，畏聖人之言。』臣莽敢不承用！臣請共事神祇、宗廟，奏言太皇太后、孝平皇后，皆稱『假皇帝』；其號令天下，天下奏言事，毋言『攝』；以居攝三年爲始初元年；漏刻以百二十爲度；用應天命。臣莽夙夜養育隆就孺子，令與周之成王比德，宣明太皇太后威德於萬方，期於富而敎之。孺子加元服，復子明辟，如周公故事。」奏可。衆庶知其奉符命，指意羣公博議別奏，以示卽眞之漸矣。","content_fanyi":"这一年，广饶侯刘京报告齐郡出现新井，车骑将军千人扈云报告巴郡出现石牛，太保属臧鸿报告扶风雍县出现瑞石；王莽都迎接并接受。十一月甲子日，王莽向太皇太后上奏说：“陛下正遭遇汉朝十二世、‘三七’之数的困厄，承受上天的威严命令，下诏命臣王莽居摄。广饶侯刘京上书说：‘七月中，齐郡临淄县昌兴亭亭长辛当一夜多次梦见有人对他说：“我是天公的使者。天公派我告诉亭长：‘摄皇帝应当成为真皇帝。’如果不信我的话，这亭中应当会出现新井。”亭长早晨起来到亭中查看，果真有一口新井，深近一百尺。’十一月壬子日，正逢冬至建日，巴郡的石牛；戊午日，雍县的石文，都送到未央宫的前殿。臣与太保安阳侯王舜等前去察看，天上刮起大风，尘土飞扬，天色昏暗；风停后，在石前得到铜符帛图，上面的文字是：‘上天告知皇帝的符命，献上者封侯，’骑都尉崔发等人察看并加以解说。孔子说：‘敬畏天命，敬畏大人，敬畏圣人之言。’臣王莽怎敢不遵奉采用！臣请求恭敬地侍奉神祇、宗庙，向太皇太后、孝平皇后奏报时，都自称‘假皇帝’；向天下发布号令，天下臣民上奏言事，不要再提‘摄’；将居摄三年改为始初元年；漏刻以一百二十为度；用以顺应天命。臣王莽日夜养育成就孺子，让他能与周成王比德，向万方宣扬太皇太后的威德，期望百姓富裕并加以教化。孺子加元服后，归还明君之位，如同周公旧例。”奏议得到许可。众人知道王莽尊奉符命，他的意图是让群臣广泛商议并另行上奏，以显示正式即位已渐渐露出苗头。","content_jianti_auto":"6是岁，广饶侯刘京言齐郡新井，车骑将军千人扈云言巴郡石牛，太保属臧鸿言扶风雍石；莽皆迎受。十一月，甲子，莽奏太后曰：「陛下遇汉十二世三七之阸，承天威命，诏臣莽居摄。广饶侯刘京上书言：『七月中，齐郡临淄县昌兴亭长辛当一暮数梦，曰：「吾，天公使也。天公使我告亭长：『摄皇帝当为真。』即不信我，此亭中当有新井。」亭长晨起视亭中，诚有新井，入地且百尺。』十一月，壬子，直建冬至，巴郡石牛；戊午，雍石文，皆到于未央宫之前殿。臣与太保安阳侯舜等视，天风起，尘冥，风止，得铜符帛图于石前，文曰：『天告帝符，献者封侯，』骑都尉崔发等视说。孔子曰：『畏天命，畏大人，畏圣人之言。』臣莽敢不承用！臣请共事神祇、宗庙，奏言太皇太后、孝平皇后，皆称『假皇帝』；其号令天下，天下奏言事，毋言『摄』；以居摄三年为始初元年；漏刻以百二十为度；用应天命。臣莽夙夜养育隆就孺子，令与周之成王比德，宣明太皇太后威德于万方，期于富而教之。孺子加元服，复子明辟，如周公故事。」奏可。众庶知其奉符命，指意群公博议别奏，以示即真之渐矣。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2791,"number":6,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三十六 (漢紀二十八) / 王莽上 / 始初元年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"92efa541-db0e-11ef-946e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":8},"tongjian_id":"92efa541-db0e-11ef-946e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"扶風","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"降，戶江翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"降，户江翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"93a21172-db0e-11ef-8dbf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93a21174-db0e-11ef-ac0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上谷郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上谷郡","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"93a21175-db0e-11ef-891d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沮陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"沮阳","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"93a21176-db0e-11ef-8ed2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢上谷郡，治沮陽。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉上谷郡，治沮阳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"93a21173-db0e-11ef-8697-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蘇忿生","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏忿生","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"93a21179-db0e-11ef-89de-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周武王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周武王","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"93a2117a-db0e-11ef-8fc0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"寇氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"寇氏","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"93a2117b-db0e-11ef-aa2a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姓譜：蘇忿生爲周武王司寇，其後以官爲寇氏。百官志：郡功曹，主選署功勞，在諸曹之上。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姓谱：苏忿生为周武王司寇，其后以官为寇氏。百官志：郡功曹，主选署功劳，在诸曹之上。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"93a21178-db0e-11ef-9550-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","resolved_place_entity_id":10164,"start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"93a21185-db0e-11ef-867a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"建武十五年，以匈奴犯塞，迁代、上谷诸郡民于居庸关以东。安...","context_before":"...唐十道志》：居庸关亦名蓟门关]。而居庸、军都，其通称也。","source_end_index":411,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"50ad45d6-4fec-5168-92d7-ca3941ef347d","source_start_index":390,"source_text":"后汉初，更始使者入上谷，耿况迎之于居庸关。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"更始北都洛陽，分遣使者徇郡國，曰：「先降者復爵位！」使者至上谷，上谷太守扶風耿況迎，上印綬；使者納之，一宿，無還意。功曹寇恂勒兵入見使者，請之，使者不與，曰：「天王使者，功曹欲脅之邪！」恂曰：「非敢脅使君，竊傷計之不詳也。今天下初定，使君建節銜命，郡國莫不延頸傾耳；今始至上谷而先墮大信，將復何以號令他郡乎！」使者不應。恂叱左右以使者命召況；況至，恂進取印綬帶況。使者不得已，乃承制詔之，況受而歸。","content_fanyi":"更始帝刘玄北迁定都洛阳，分别派遣使者巡视各郡国，宣布诏命说：“先投降的人，恢复原有的爵位官位！”使者到达上谷郡，上谷郡太守扶风人耿况出城迎接，交上印信绶带；使者收下印绶，过了一夜，却没有归还的意思。郡功曹寇恂带领士兵入内拜见使者，请求发还印绶，使者不给，说：“我是天子的使者，功曹想要威胁我吗！”寇恂说：“不敢威胁使君，只是私下痛惜使君的计策不够周详，前景不妙。现在天下刚刚平定，使君手持符节、奉行诏命，各郡国没有不伸长脖子、倾耳恭听的；如今刚到上谷，就先自行毁弃重大的信用，还将拿什么去号令其他郡呢！”使者没有回应。寇恂呵斥左右随从，让他们假借使者的命令去召耿况前来；耿况到来后，寇恂上前取过印绶，给耿况佩带在身上。使者不得已，只好秉承天子的制命下诏给耿况，耿况接受印绶后告辞回府。","content_jianti_auto":"更始北都洛阳，分遣使者徇郡国，曰：「先降者复爵位！」使者至上谷，上谷太守扶风耿况迎，上印绶；使者纳之，一宿，无还意。功曹寇恂勒兵入见使者，请之，使者不与，曰：「天王使者，功曹欲胁之邪！」恂曰：「非敢胁使君，窃伤计之不详也。今天下初定，使君建节衔命，郡国莫不延颈倾耳；今始至上谷而先堕大信，将复何以号令他郡乎！」使者不应。恂叱左右以使者命召况；况至，恂进取印绶带况。使者不得已，乃承制诏之，况受而归。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，赤眉帅樊崇将渠帅二十余人入见，安危存亡之大机也，于此失...","context_before":"王莽既诛，","source_end_index":11,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"866b9adf-0604-4f48-8544-8823cf5e66b7","source_start_index":5,"source_text":"更始定都雒阳"}],"title":"三 更始受赤眉降而亡"}],"id":2976,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三十九 (漢紀三十一) / 淮陽王 / 更始元年 / 第 26 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"93a21171-db0e-11ef-aaa1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":23},"tongjian_id":"93a21171-db0e-11ef-aaa1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"扶風","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"941abae2-db0e-11ef-b83e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"941abae3-db0e-11ef-b411-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陰縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"阴县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"941abae4-db0e-11ef-ba70-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南阳郡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"941abae5-db0e-11ef-96a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄州","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄州","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"941abae6-db0e-11ef-b39c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"穀城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"谷城县","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"941abae7-db0e-11ef-9e39-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沔水","place_name_jianti_auto":"沔水","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"941abae8-db0e-11ef-afde-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"穀城","place_name_jianti_auto":"谷城","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"941abae9-db0e-11ef-b148-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陰縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"阴县","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"941abaea-db0e-11ef-acf6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"光化軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"光化军","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"941abaeb-db0e-11ef-bff5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陰縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"阴县","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"941abaec-db0e-11ef-95df-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：陰縣，屬南陽郡；故城在今襄州穀城縣界北。水經註：沔水南逕穀城東，又南過陰縣西。宋白曰：今光化軍，本陰縣地。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：阴县，属南阳郡；故城在今襄州谷城县界北。水经注：沔水南迳谷城东，又南过阴县西。宋白曰：今光化军，本阴县地。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"941abae1-db0e-11ef-a727-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"竟","people_name_jianti_auto":"竟","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"941abaef-db0e-11ef-baff-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"前此帝嘗用竟爲侍中。說，輸芮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"前此帝尝用竟为侍中。说，输芮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"941abaee-db0e-11ef-a057-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","resolved_place_entity_id":10164,"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"941abaf7-db0e-11ef-aa0c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、襄阳府（卷七十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋属顺阳郡。刘宋属广平郡。齐、梁因之。西魏改曰阴城县，后...","context_before":"...于下阴，盖迁阴地之戎于此。汉置阴县，属南阳郡。后汉因之。","source_end_index":91,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"325bb0fc-fe08-5fd5-acec-e7f5f81052f1","source_start_index":70,"source_text":"建武三年，延岑将邓仲况拥兵据阴县，降于汉。"}],"path":"湖广方舆纪要/八、襄阳府（卷七十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"延岑護軍鄧仲況擁兵據陰縣，而劉歆孫龔爲其謀主。前侍中扶風蘇竟以書說之，仲況與龔降。竟終不伐其功，隱身樂道，壽終於家。","content_fanyi":"延岑的护军邓仲况拥兵占据阴县，而刘歆的孙子刘龚是他的谋主。前侍中扶风人苏竟写信劝说邓仲况，邓仲况与刘龚于是听从劝说归降。苏竟始终不居功自傲，隐居于故里，安贫乐道，终老于家中。","content_jianti_auto":"延岑护军邓仲况拥兵据阴县，而刘歆孙龚为其谋主。前侍中扶风苏竟以书说之，仲况与龚降。竟终不伐其功，隐身乐道，寿终于家。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3136,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十一 (漢紀三十三) / 世祖光武皇帝上之下 / 建武三年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"941abae0-db0e-11ef-aed4-a0d3651f611f","year_int":27},"tongjian_id":"941abae0-db0e-11ef-aed4-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"扶風","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漁陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"渔阳郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94273661-db0e-11ef-8258-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"94273662-db0e-11ef-aa9d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"郡國志：漁陽郡，在雒陽東北二千里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"郡国志：渔阳郡，在雒阳东北二千里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"94273660-db0e-11ef-9d7a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9427365f-db0e-11ef-9415-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"jí","source_anchor_text":"以扶風郭伋為漁陽太","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":6,"text":"伋","tongjian_id":"491c130c-3526-57bc-a6e8-21c0ba103a76"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","resolved_place_entity_id":10164,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"94273665-db0e-11ef-95bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"7帝以扶風郭伋爲漁陽太守。伋承離亂之後，養民訓兵，開示威信，盜賊銷散，匈奴遠迹；在職五年，戶口增倍。","content_fanyi":"光武帝任命扶风人郭伋为渔阳太守。郭伋在历经离乱之后接任，抚育百姓、训练士兵，宣示威信，盗贼消散，匈奴远避；在职五年，户口增加一倍。","content_jianti_auto":"7帝以扶风郭伋为渔阳太守。伋承离乱之后，养民训兵，开示威信，盗贼销散，匈奴远迹；在职五年，户口增倍。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3172,"number":7,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十一 (漢紀三十三) / 世祖光武皇帝上之下 / 五年 / 第 8 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9427365f-db0e-11ef-9415-a0d3651f611f","year_int":29},"tongjian_id":"9427365f-db0e-11ef-9415-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"扶風","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94651ca1-db0e-11ef-ab0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏門","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏门","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94651ca2-db0e-11ef-8d93-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"雒陽十二城門，夏門位在亥。","note_content_jianti_auto":"雒阳十二城门，夏门位在亥。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"94651ca0-db0e-11ef-93ea-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"94651ca4-db0e-11ef-9b42-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"百官志：城門校尉掌雒陽十二城門，每門候一人。邯，戶甘翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"百官志：城门校尉掌雒阳十二城门，每门候一人。邯，户甘翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"94651ca3-db0e-11ef-9984-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蔡質","people_name_jianti_auto":"蔡质","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"94651ca8-db0e-11ef-83d5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"94651ca9-db0e-11ef-98f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"百官志：司隸校尉從事史十二人，都官從事，主察舉百官犯法者。蔡質漢儀曰：都官主雒陽朝會，與三府掾同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"百官志：司隶校尉从事史十二人，都官从事，主察举百官犯法者。蔡质汉仪曰：都官主雒阳朝会，与三府掾同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"94651ca7-db0e-11ef-b6f2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","resolved_place_entity_id":10164,"start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"94651cb8-db0e-11ef-87f4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"5趙王良從帝送歙喪還，入夏城門，與中郞將張邯爭道，叱邯旋車；又詰責門候，使前走數十步。司隸校尉鮑永劾奏「良無藩臣禮，大不敬。」良尊戚貴重，而永劾之，朝廷肅然。永辟扶風鮑恢爲都官從事，恢亦抗直，不避強禦。帝常曰：「貴戚且斂手以避二鮑。」","content_fanyi":"赵王刘良随光武帝送完来歙的丧事返回，从夏城门进入，与中郎将张邯争路，喝令张邯调转车头；又责问门候，命他向前跑出几十步。司隶校尉鲍永上奏弹劾说：“刘良没有藩臣应有的礼数，这是大不敬。”刘良身为尊贵的皇亲国戚，鲍永却弹劾他，朝廷上下为之肃然。鲍永征召扶风人鲍恢为都官从事，鲍恢也刚直不屈，不避强横。光武帝常常说：“贵戚们姑且收敛双手，回避二鲍。”","content_jianti_auto":"5赵王良从帝送歙丧还，入夏城门，与中郞将张邯争道，叱邯旋车；又诘责门候，使前走数十步。司隶校尉鲍永劾奏「良无藩臣礼，大不敬。」良尊戚贵重，而永劾之，朝廷肃然。永辟扶风鲍恢为都官从事，恢亦抗直，不避强御。帝常曰：「贵戚且敛手以避二鲍。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3298,"number":5,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十二 (漢紀三十四) / 世祖光武皇帝中之上 / 十一年 / 第 8 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94651c9f-db0e-11ef-94d1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":35,"zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000660"},"tongjian_id":"94651c9f-db0e-11ef-94d1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"扶風","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"三河","place_name_jianti_auto":"三河","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"94651cbd-db0e-11ef-8bda-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"三輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"三辅","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"94651cbe-db0e-11ef-81a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"弘農","place_name_jianti_auto":"弘农","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"94651cbf-db0e-11ef-8002-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"霸陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"霸陵县","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"94651cc0-db0e-11ef-845a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"94651cc1-db0e-11ef-9d2f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"司隸校尉，主三河、三輔、弘農。霸陵縣，屬京兆。行，下孟翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"司隶校尉，主三河、三辅、弘农。霸陵县，属京兆。行，下孟翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94651cbc-db0e-11ef-8eac-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":16,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"苟諫保護鮑永事見三十六卷更始二年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"93b720ee-db0e-11ef-b847-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"苟諫","people_name_jianti_auto":"苟谏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94651cc3-db0e-11ef-a61a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鮑永","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲍永","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94651cc4-db0e-11ef-aa10-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"苟諫保護鮑永事見三十六卷更始二年。上，時掌翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苟谏保护鲍永事见三十六卷更始二年。上，时掌翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"94651cc2-db0e-11ef-b3cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94651cc6-db0e-11ef-89f3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"武帝置十三州刺史，皆部使者也。司隸今出所部，故言奉使。使，疏吏翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"武帝置十三州刺史，皆部使者也。司隶今出所部，故言奉使。使，疏吏翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"94651cc5-db0e-11ef-9738-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","resolved_place_entity_id":10164,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"94651ccc-db0e-11ef-836b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"永行縣到霸陵，路經更始墓，下拜，哭盡哀而去；西至扶風，椎牛上苟諫冢。帝聞之，意不平，問公卿曰：「奉使如此，何如？」太中大夫張湛對曰：「仁者，行之宗，忠者，義之主也；仁不遺舊，忠不忘君，行之高者也。」帝意乃釋。","content_fanyi":"鲍永巡视各县来到霸陵，路过更始帝的墓，下车拜祭，尽情痛哭后才离开；向西到扶风后，又杀牛前往苟谏墓上祭扫。光武帝得知此事，心里很不满，问公卿大臣：“奉命出使却这么做，该当如何？”太中大夫张湛答道：“仁是行为的根本，忠是道义的主宰；仁不抛弃旧交，忠不忘记君王，这是高尚的举动。”光武帝的怒意才平息。","content_jianti_auto":"永行县到霸陵，路经更始墓，下拜，哭尽哀而去；西至扶风，椎牛上苟谏冢。帝闻之，意不平，问公卿曰：「奉使如此，何如？」太中大夫张湛对曰：「仁者，行之宗，忠者，义之主也；仁不遗旧，忠不忘君，行之高者也。」帝意乃释。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3299,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十二 (漢紀三十四) / 世祖光武皇帝中之上 / 十一年 / 第 9 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"94651cbb-db0e-11ef-890d-a0d3651f611f","year_int":35},"tongjian_id":"94651cbb-db0e-11ef-890d-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"扶風","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"武都郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"武都郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9467af98-db0e-11ef-b683-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9467af99-db0e-11ef-afad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"郡國志：武都郡在雒陽西一千九百里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"郡国志：武都郡在雒阳西一千九百里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9467af97-db0e-11ef-9eef-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9467af96-db0e-11ef-a52c-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"mén","source_anchor_text":"寇鈔拒浩亹隘成與馬","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":30,"text":"亹","tongjian_id":"bc703407-bdf1-56d1-96ec-597bc704967c"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","resolved_place_entity_id":10164,"start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"9467afa8-db0e-11ef-bcf3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十三、西宁卫（卷六十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"其后马贤、庞参往往树绩于此。晋室多故，张氏据有河西，亦能...","context_before":"...不使居湟中。宣帝时，赵充国留屯金城，尽平诸羌，关陇宁谧。","source_end_index":186,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3d025719-cac5-51c5-93e7-c9788d2dce2b","source_start_index":94,"source_text":"后汉建武十一年，马援等击破先零诸种羌。时议者以金城破羌之西，途远多寇，欲弃之。马援因上言：破羌以西，城多坚牢，易可依固。其田土肥壤，灌溉流通。如令羌在湟中，则为害不休，不可弃也。从之。"},{"context_after":"又中元二年，西羌寇陇右，马武将兵讨之，战金城浩枌，复追击...","context_before":"...至浩枌，为羌所败，还令居。后汉亦为浩枌县。或谓之浩枌隘。","source_end_index":170,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"7b29ec1c-2707-52a4-8897-02078876d256","source_start_index":131,"source_text":"建武十一年，先零羌与诸种羌寇金城陇西，据浩枌隘。陇西太守马援深入讨击，大败之。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十三、西宁卫（卷六十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"10馬成等破河池，遂平武都。先零諸種羌數萬人，屯聚寇鈔，拒浩亹隘。成與馬援深入討擊，大破之，徙降羌置天水、隴西、扶風。","content_fanyi":"马成等攻取河池，随后平定武都。先零等各部羌人数万人，屯聚抢掠，凭据浩亹隘抗拒。马成与马援率军深入征讨，大破羌众，将降附的羌人迁徙安置在天水、陇西、扶风。","content_jianti_auto":"10马成等破河池，遂平武都。先零诸种羌数万人，屯聚寇钞，拒浩亹隘。成与马援深入讨击，大破之，徙降羌置天水、陇西、扶风。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3306,"number":10,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十二 (漢紀三十四) / 世祖光武皇帝中之上 / 十一年 / 第 16 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"9467af96-db0e-11ef-a52c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":35},"tongjian_id":"9467af96-db0e-11ef-a52c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"扶風","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"上黨郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上党郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"949257d8-db0e-11ef-b38e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"949257d9-db0e-11ef-a117-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"天水郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"天水郡","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"949257da-db0e-11ef-8aef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_na